{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "name": "load-fanout-50",
  "description": "Load scenario fanout-50 (ticket 19.1): a seed `llm` step fans out to 50 independent `llm` steps that fan back into a single `join` (mode all) and a final `llm`. 53 steps per run, a 53-node instantiation transaction, and 50 concurrent completions decrementing one join-counter row \u2014 the stress for hypotheses H2 (write amplification), H4 (join-counter hot row), and H6 (submission-path instantiation cost). Fully offline on model `mock/load-fast`.",
